      "sourceTextSha256": "f0d8673ecbb15c35e2b42d2b372b676a1a642af85a73b4f146340db41e57dbff",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Salta International Airport, where your private guide welcomes you for the transfer to Cafayate (approx. 3 hours). Begin your exploration of Cafayate, one of Argentina’s renowned wine-producing towns, with a visit to a local winery to discover the main stages of wine production, from vineyard cultivation and harvesting to processing and the making of different varieties.\n\nEnjoy free time to explore the town and its surrounding vineyards, with lunch at a local restaurant (not included), followed by a visit to the Wine Museum. Overnight in Cafayate.",
